title: "Perf Sentinel plugin for Claude Code: performance integration tests checked by Perf Sentinel"
abstract: "A Claude Code plugin whose perf-tests skill writes production-shaped performance integration tests for a change, runs them under Perf Sentinel to catch N+1, redundant and slow I/O before production, proposes targeted fixes and wires the check into CI."
